{"id":"word:hebrew:H5785","type":"word","title":"עוֹר","subtitle":"H5785 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"skin (as naked); by implication, hide , leather","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to עוֹר (H5785) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 99 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"עוֹר (ʻôwr) means skin (as naked); by implication, hide , leather First listed occurrence: 2Kgs 1 8."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"עוֹר","transliteration":"ʻôwr","pronunciation":"ore","strong":"H5785","lemmaId":"hebrew:H5785","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["ע֣וֹר","הָ/ע֔וֹר","בָּ/ע֑וֹר","בָּ/ע֔וֹר","ע֖וֹר"],"morphs":[["HNcmsa",15],["HRd/Ncmsa",15],["HTd/Ncmsa",14],["HNcmsc",13],["HR/Ncmsc",9],["HNcmpc",7],["HC/Ncmpc",6],["HNcmsc/Sp3ms",5],["HR/Ncmsc/Sp3ms",3],["HNcmsc/Sp1cs",3]]},"definitions":{"short":"skin (as naked); by implication, hide , leather","usage":"hide, leather, skin.","full":"H5785. or עוֺר 99 noun masculine Job 7:5 skin ( Late Hebrew id. ; Phoenician ערת Lzb 346 ); — ׳ע absolute Gen 3:21 +, construct Exod 34:29 +; suffix עֹרוֺ 29:14 +, עוֺרוֺ Jer 13:23 , עֹרָהּ Num 19:5 , etc.; plural construct עֹרֹת Gen 27:16 +, עוֺרֹת Exod 39:34 suffix עֹרֹתָם Lev 16:27 ; &#8212; skin: 1 of men (55 t.), לְעֹרוֺ שִׂמְלָתוֺ Exod 22:26 (E), ׳ע מָּנָיו 34:29-30 , compare 34:35 (all P); (dark) skin of Cushite Jer 13:23 ; see also Ezek 37:6 , 8 ; Lam 3:8 ; Job 7:5 ; 10:11 , +; in hyperbole Micah 3:2-3 , שִׁנָּ֑י עוֺר Job 19:20 b the skin of my teeth , i.e. gums (si vera lectio); also Lev 13:2 33 t. Leviticus 13 (P), in tests for leprosy (see especially בְּֿשָׂרוֺ׳ע 13:2 ; 13:2 ; 13:3 ; 13:4 ; 13:11 , compare 13:3 ; 13:38 ; 13:39 ; 13:43 ); עוֺר בְּעַד עוֺר Job 2:4 skin in behalf of, for, skin , apparently proverb. phrase of barter, = everything has its price (on varieties of interpretation see Commentaries). 2 hide of animals (44 t.), always — except Job 40:31 — after skinning: Gen 27:16 (J); of sacrifice victims Exod 29:14 ; Lev 4:11 5 t. (all P); prepared for use (by some process of tanning, compare Now Archaeology i. 242 ), sometimes = leather: material of garments Gen 3:21 (J), girdle 2Kin 1:8 , any article Lev 11:32 ; 13:48 ff Num 31:20 (P); covering of tabernacle Exod 25:5 (twice in verse) + 10 t. Exodus 26; Exodus 35; Exodus 36; Exodus 39, of ark, sacred utensils, etc., Num 4:6 5 t. Numbers 4.. עורים Isa 30:6 see עַיִר .","rootNote":"from 5783 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Kgs 1 8","keyReferences":["2Kgs 1 8","Exod 22 26","Exod 25 5","Exod 25 5","Exod 26 14","Exod 26 14","Exod 29 14","Exod 34 29"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":99,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Kgs 1 8","book":"2Kgs","chapter":1,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"ע֖וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Exod 22 26","book":"Exod","chapter":22,"verse":26,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/עֹר֑/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Exod 25 5","book":"Exod","chapter":25,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/עֹרֹ֨ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpc"},{"reference":"Exod 25 5","book":"Exod","chapter":25,"verse":5,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וְ/עֹרֹ֥ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Ncmpc"},{"reference":"Exod 26 14","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֹרֹ֥ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"Exod 26 14","book":"Exod","chapter":26,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֹרֹ֥ת","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpc"},{"reference":"Exod 29 14","book":"Exod","chapter":29,"verse":14,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"עֹר֣/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Exod 34 29","book":"Exod","chapter":34,"verse":29,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"ע֥וֹר","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Exod 34 